<title>JAPAN: Bandai rebuked by TSE over disclosure delay.</title>
<headline>Bandai rebuked by TSE over disclosure delay.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bandai Co Ltd said on Monday it had received a strict warning from the Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) about a delay in announcing the cancellation of a planned merger.</p>
<p>&quot;We received a strict warning from the TSE. We will work hard to improve our (disclosure) procedure,&quot; a Bandai spokesman said.</p>
<p>In late May, Bandai abruptly announced it had called off a merger with Sega Enterprises Ltd because it lacked synergy. The merger had been due to take place on October 1.</p>
</text>
